# ── PII scrubbing scripts ──
# Skills that document the scrub procedure are not themselves scrub scripts,
# and must stay tracked. This exception covers both spellings, and the
# public-skills copy as well as the skills/ one: the first version listed
# only skills/repo-pii-scrub/, so the generated publish copy was silently
# dropped from the repo.
*pii*scrub*
*scrub*pii*
!public-skills/repo-pii-scrub/
!public-skills/repo-pii-scrub/**
!skills/repo-pii-scrub/
!skills/repo-pii-scrub/**

# ── Git ──
# Note: .gitignore is intentionally NOT ignored so it can be versioned

# ── Docker ──
.docker/
Projects/
hermes-retrieval-reflex/
oc-work/
personal-agent/
