# ── Bundled-skill exceptions ──
# The categories above are ignored in bulk because they are large, mostly
# upstream, and not required to run a fresh install. A skill that a CRON JOB
# depends on must be tracked, or the job breaks on a clean install.
#
# Job-required skills live FLAT (skills/<name>/SKILL.md) so they are not
# shadowed by the category ignores above. Do not nest one under a category
# directory: that is how wiki-cognition ended up invisible to a fresh clone.

